### 1. 회원 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "홍길동",
  "email": "hong@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 2. 회원 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/1

### 3. 리뷰 작성
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
"storeName": "이삭토스트",
"rating": 4,
"content": "아침에 간단히 먹기 좋아요.",
"memberId": 1
}

### 4. 리뷰 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/1